## USE CASES — LEARNER SUPPORT PORTAL
1. Use Case Diagram Actors
The system has three actors:

Learner
Registers on the system and uses the portal to manage learning activities and access support/resources.

Assessor
Logs in using credentials provided by the Admin and supports learners.

Admin
Controls assessor account creation and system access.

